<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>RESEARCH ANALYST SERVICE AGREEMENT - InvestBay.in</title>
    <style>
        body {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 25px;
            font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #000;
            background-color: #fff;
            font-size: 12pt;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 1000px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            background-color: #ffffff;
            padding: 30px;
        }

        .header {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
            padding-bottom: 20px;
            border-bottom: 2px solid #000;
        }

        .header h1 {
            color: #000;
            margin: 0 0 10px 0;
            font-size: 18pt;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        .header h2 {
            color: #000;
            margin: 0;
            font-size: 14pt;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        .parties-box {
            padding: 20px;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
            border: 1px solid #000;
        }

        .section-title {
            font-size: 14pt;
            margin: 25px 0 15px 0;
            padding-bottom: 8px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #000;
        }

        .declaration-box {
            padding: 15px;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
            border: 1px solid #000;
        }

        .signature-table {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: collapse;
            font-size: 12pt;
            border-top: 2px solid #000;
            padding-top: 30px;
            margin-top: 40px;
        }

        .signature-col {
            width: 50%;
            padding: 0 20px 50px 0;
            text-align: center;
            border-right: 1px solid #000;
        }

        .signature-col:last-child {
            border-right: none;
            padding-left: 20px;
        }

        .signature-line {
            margin-bottom: 25px;
            position: relative;
        }

        .signature-line p {
            margin: 0;
            font-size: 14pt;
            font-weight: bold;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #000;
            padding-bottom: 8px;
            min-height: 30px;
        }

        .signature-image {
            max-width: 200px;
            max-height: 60px;
            object-fit: contain;
            margin-top: 10px;
        }

        .appendix {
            padding: 25px;
            margin-top: 40px;
            border: 1px solid #000;
        }

        .footer {
            text-align: center;
            margin-top: 40px;
            padding-top: 25px;
            border-top: 1px solid #ccc;
            font-size: 10pt;
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>
    <div class="container">

        <!-- HEADER -->
        <div class="header">
            <h1>This Agreement ("Agreement") is made and entered into as of <%= EffectiveDate %> (the "Signing Date")
            </h1>
            <h2>This SERVICE Agreement ("Agreement") is made between</h2>
        </div>

        <!-- PARTIES -->
        <div class="parties-box">
            <p style="font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold; margin: 0 0 12px 0;">
                <%= RA_FullName %>, having its registered office at <%= RA_Address %> (hereinafter referred to as
                        "Service Provider" or "RA") and
            </p>
            <p style="font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold; margin: 0 0 12px 0;">
                <%= UserName %>, PAN: <%= UserPAN %>, officially registered on InvestBay.in (hereinafter referred to as
                        "User").
            </p>
            <p style="font-size: 11pt; margin: 0; font-style: italic;">The Service Provider and the User are hereinafter
                individually referred to as a "Party" and collectively referred to as the "Parties".</p>
        </div>

        <!-- DEFINITIONS -->
        <h2 class="section-title">DEFINITIONS:</h2>
        <div style="padding: 15px; margin-bottom: 25px; border: 1px solid #ccc;">
            <p style="margin: 0 0 8px 0;"><strong>"User"</strong> refers to any individual who avails services after
                consenting to this agreement.</p>
            <p style="margin: 0 0 8px 0;"><strong>"Service Provider"</strong> is a SEBI-registered Research Analyst
                (RA).</p>
            <p style="margin: 0;"><strong>"InvestBay"</strong> refers to the platform owned by Katalx Technologies Pvt
                Ltd, used by SEBI-registered RAs for managing and delivering research services such as recommendations
                across asset class, educational content, and webinars.</p>
        </div>

        <!-- ELIGIBILITY & REGISTRATION -->
        <h3 style="font-size: 12pt; margin: 25px 0 12px 0; font-weight: bold;">ELIGIBILITY & REGISTRATION:</h3>
        <p style="margin: 0 0 12px 0;">Registration requires accurate information, completion of KYC, and agreement to
            these terms.</p>
        <p style="margin: 0 0 25px 0;">InvestBay.in and the Service Provider may modify their policies and fee
            structures; such updates will be published on the platform.</p>

        <!-- AGREEMENT SCOPE -->
        <h3 style="font-size: 12pt; margin: 25px 0 12px 0; font-weight: bold;">AGREEMENT SCOPE:</h3>
        <p style="margin: 0 0 12px 0;">RA and client shall be bound by SEBI Act and all the applicable rules and
            regulations of SEBI, including the RA Regulations and relevant notifications of Government, as may be in
            force, from time to time.</p>
        <p style="margin: 0 0 12px 0;">The User desires non-exclusive, non-binding stock recommendations from the
            Service Provider.</p>
        <p style="margin: 0 0 12px 0;"><strong>The Service Provider holds a valid SEBI registration: <%=
                    RA_SEBI_Registration_Number %> with registration date <%= Registration_Date %>.</strong></p>
        <p style="margin: 0 0 25px 0; font-weight: bold;">Recommendations are for the User's personal investment
            decisions and subject to Market risks.</p>

        <!-- USER DECLARATIONS -->
        <h3 style="font-size: 12pt; margin: 25px 0 12px 0; font-weight: bold;">USER DECLARATIONS:</h3>
        <div class="declaration-box">
            <p style="margin: 0 0 8px 0;">The User understands risks, makes investment decisions independently, and will
                not hold the Service Provider or InvestBay liable for financial loss.</p>
            <p style="margin: 0 0 8px 0;">Any investment made based on recommendations in research reports are subject
                to market risks, and recommendations do not provide any assurance of returns.</p>
            <p style="margin: 0 0 8px 0;"><strong>There is no recourse to claim any losses incurred on the investments
                    made based on the recommendations in the research report.</strong></p>
            <p style="margin: 0 0 8px 0;">Any reliance placed on the research report provided by the Service Provider
                shall be as per the user's own judgement and assessment of the conclusions contained in the research
                report.</p>
            <p style="margin: 0 0 8px 0;">The User agrees to maintain updated contact details and not to share
                confidential Research content or login credentials.</p>
            <p style="margin: 0 0 8px 0;">In the event of RA suspension or SEBI action, prepaid fees will be refunded
                proportionately.</p>
            <p style="margin: 0 0 8px 0;">The User shall comply with all applicable laws and InvestBay platform terms.
            </p>
            <p style="margin: 0 0 8px 0;">User agrees to inform service provider information related to family members
                who have sought or are currently seeking services from services provider in the given financial year.
            </p>
            <p style="margin: 0 0 8px 0; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold;">Never share login credentials and OTPs for
                the User's Trading Account Demat Account and Bank Account with anyone including Service Provider. User
                shall not permit Service Provider to execute any trade on their behalf.</p>
            <p style="margin: 0 0 8px 0;">User understands that in case of pre-mature termination of the RA services by
                either the User or the Service Provider, the User shall be entitled to seek refund of proportionate fees
                only for unexpired period, after deducting all the expenses Service Provider incurred to procure the
                user and all statutory liabilities.</p>
            <p style="margin: 0;">User understands that the SEBI registration, Enlistment with RAASB, and NISM
                certification do not guarantee the performance of the Service Provider or assure any returns to the
                user.</p>
        </div>

        <!-- SERVICE PROVIDER DECLARATIONS -->
        <h3 style="font-size: 12pt; margin: 25px 0 12px 0; font-weight: bold;">SERVICE PROVIDER DECLARATIONS:</h3>
        <div class="declaration-box">
            <p style="margin: 0 0 8px 0;">It is duly registered with SEBI as an Research Analyst pursuant to the SEBI
                (Research Analysts) Regulations, 2014 and its registration details are: (Reg No: <%=
                    RA_SEBI_Registration_Number %>, Reg Date: <%= Registration_Date %>); and is valid and subsisting.
            </p>
            <p style="margin: 0 0 8px 0;">Recommendations are based on analysis but do not assure returns.</p>
            <p style="margin: 0 0 8px 0;">Fee charged by Service Provider to the User will be subject to the maximum of
                amount prescribed by SEBI/ Research Analyst Administration and Supervisory Body (RAASB).</p>
            <p style="margin: 0 0 8px 0;">Service Provider is charging fees in advance as agreed by the User. This
                advance does not exceed the period stipulated by SEBI; and in the event of premature termination,
                refunds will be issued proportionately after necessary deductions.</p>
            <p style="margin: 0 0 8px 0; font-weight: bold;"><strong>Service Provider cannot execute/carry out any trade
                    (purchase/sell transaction) on behalf of the User.</strong></p>
            <p style="margin: 0 0 8px 0;">The client shall duly pay to RA, the agreed fees for the services that RA
                renders to the client and statutory charges, as applicable. Such fees and statutory charges shall be
                payable through the specified manner and mode(s)/ mechanism(s) like cheque, online bank transfer, UPI,
                etc. Cash payment is not allowed.</p>
            <p style="margin: 0 0 8px 0;">Abide by the applicable regulations/ circulars/ directions specified by SEBI
                and RAASB from time to time in relation to disclosure and mitigation of any actual or potential conflict
                of interest. The Service Provider will endeavor to promptly inform the User of any conflict of interest
                that may affect the services being rendered to the User.</p>
            <p style="margin: 0 0 8px 0;"><strong>Any assured/guaranteed/fixed returns schemes or any other schemes of
                    similar nature are prohibited by law. Hence, no scheme of this nature is being offered to the User
                    by the Service Provider.</strong></p>
            <p style="margin: 0 0 8px 0;">It has registration and qualifications required to render the services
                contemplated under the RA Regulations, and the same are valid and subsisting;</p>
            <p style="margin: 0;">Research analyst services provided by it do not conflict with or violate any provision
                of law, rule or regulation, contract, or other instrument to which it is a party or to which any of its
                property is or may be subject;</p>
        </div>

        <!-- SCOPE OF SERVICES -->
        <h3 style="font-size: 12pt; margin: 25px 0 12px 0; font-weight: bold;">SCOPE OF SERVICES:</h3>
        <p style="margin: 0 0 12px 0;">Research services and Recommendations will be provided only to register Users for
            duration as per subscription terms through the InvestBay.in platform.</p>
        <p style="margin: 0 0 25px 0;">Users availing services are bound by the Terms of Service provided on the
            official website of InvestBay.in. The latest Terms of Service can be accessed at: <a
                href="https://www.InvestBay.in/legal/terms"
                style="color: #000; text-decoration: underline;">https://www.InvestBay.in/legal/terms</a></p>

        <!-- USER OBLIGATIONS -->
        <h3 style="font-size: 12pt; margin: 25px 0 12px 0; font-weight: bold;">USER OBLIGATIONS:</h3>
        <p style="margin: 0 0 8px 0;">User may choose to act on recommendations at their sole discretion.</p>
        <p style="margin: 0 0 8px 0;">The User shall furnish information as requested for compliance.</p>
        <p style="margin: 0 0 8px 0;">User shall not distribute service content through any medium without
            authorization.</p>
        <p style="margin: 0 0 8px 0;">InvestBay trademarks and content are protected and must not be reused without
            permission.</p>
        <p style="margin: 0 0 25px 0;">By accepting delivery of the research service, the client confirms that he/she
            has elected to subscribe the research service of the RA at his/her sole discretion.</p>

        <!-- CONFLICT OF INTEREST -->
        <h4 style="font-size: 11pt; margin: 20px 0 10px 0; font-weight: bold;">Conflict of interest:</h4>
        <p style="margin: 0 0 25px 0;">The RA shall adhere to the applicable regulations/ circulars/ directions
            specified by SEBI from time to time in relation to disclosure and mitigation of any actual or potential
            conflict of interest.</p>

        <!-- DISCLAIMERS -->
        <h3 style="font-size: 12pt; margin: 25px 0 12px 0; font-weight: bold;">DISCLAIMERS:</h3>
        <p style="margin: 0 0 12px 0; font-weight: bold;"><strong>Neither the Service Provider nor InvestBay guarantees
                returns.</strong></p>
        <p style="margin: 0 0 30px 0; font-weight: bold;"><strong>InvestBay is not responsible for accuracy of the
                content provided by Service Provider or the advices given outside of InvestBay platform.</strong></p>

        <!-- GRIEVANCE REDRESSAL -->
        <h3 style="font-size: 12pt; margin: 25px 0 12px 0; font-weight: bold;">GRIEVANCE REDRESSAL:</h3>
        <ol style="margin: 0 0 15px 25px; padding-left: 20px;">
            <li style="margin-bottom: 6px;"><strong>Step 1:</strong> Email initial complaints to <strong>
                    <%= ra_complaint_email %>
                </strong>.</li>
            <li style="margin-bottom: 6px;"><strong>Step 2:</strong> Escalate unresolved issues to <strong>
                    <%= ra_complaint_email %>
                </strong>.</li>
            <li style="margin-bottom: 15px;"><strong>Step 3:</strong> If unresolved, lodge with SEBI via SCORES (<a
                    href="http://www.scores.sebi.gov.in"
                    style="color: #000; text-decoration: underline;">www.scores.sebi.gov.in</a>) or Smart ODR (<a
                    href="https://smartodr.in"
                    style="color: #000; text-decoration: underline;">https://smartodr.in</a>).</li>
        </ol>
        <p style="margin: 0 0 30px 0; font-weight: bold;">All grievances will be addressed within 21 (twenty-one)
            business days or as per latest SEBI RA Regulations.</p>

        <!-- KYC & FORCE MAJEURE -->
        <h3 style="font-size: 12pt; margin: 25px 0 12px 0; font-weight: bold;">KYC & FORCE MAJEURE:</h3>
        <p style="margin: 0 0 12px 0;">If the User's KYC (Know Your Customer) details are not available or registered
            with a KYC Registration Agency (KRA) at the time of subscribing to a Service Provider, the User will not be
            able to avail the services until the KYC is registered/approved by KRA agency. KYC verification with the
            relevant KRA is mandatory before subscribing to any service on InvestBay.in. Users must ensure their KYC is
            successfully registered with a KRA before proceeding with any subscription.</p>
        <p style="margin: 0 0 30px 0;">Neither Service Provider nor InvestBay will be liable for service disruptions due
            to force majeure events. The Service provider including its principals, partners, employees, affiliates,
            agents, representatives, and subcontractors, shall not be liable for losses or damages caused by or
            resulting from any event of force majeure beyond its control including, but not limited to, acts of civil or
            military authority, national emergencies, fire, flood, catastrophe, act of God, explosion, war, riot, theft,
            accident, nationalization, expropriation, currency restrictions, pandemic, lock-down imposed by governmental
            authorities, other measures taken by any government or agency of any country, state or territory in the
            world, actions taken by any regulatory authority regulating asset managers, amendments to Applicable Laws,
            industrial action or labour disturbances of any nature amongst employees of Service provider or of its
            agents or of any third parties, boycotts, work stoppages, power failures or breakdowns in communication
            links or equipment(including, but not limited to, loss of electronic data), international conflicts, violent
            or armed actions, acts of terrorism, insurrection, revolution, or failure or disruption of any relevant
            stock exchange, clearinghouse, clearing or settlement systems or market. In the event of equipment
            breakdowns beyond Service provider's and InvestBay's control, the Service provider shall take reasonable
            steps to minimize service interruptions but shall have no liability with respect thereto. The Service
            provider also disclaim any liability for future consequences arising under the Prevention of Money
            Laundering Act, 2002, or any analogous legislation, regulations, or rules.</p>

        <!-- SEVERABILITY & FINAL TERMS -->
        <h3 style="font-size: 12pt; margin: 25px 0 12px 0; font-weight: bold;">SEVERABILITY & FINAL TERMS:</h3>
        <p style="margin: 0 0 12px 0;">If any part of the Agreement is held unenforceable, the remaining provisions will
            remain in effect.</p>
        <p style="margin: 0 0 40px 0;">Key terms regarding tenure, jurisdiction, termination, and arbitration are
            defined in Appendix 1.</p>

        <!-- SIGNATURES -->
        <table class="signature-table">
            <tr>
                <td class="signature-col">
                    <div class="signature-line">
                        <% if (typeof RA_Signature !=='undefined' && RA_Signature && RA_Signature.trim() !=='' ) { %>
                            <img src="<%= RA_Signature %>" alt="RA Signature" class="signature-image" />
                            <% } else { %>
                                <p>______________________________</p>
                                <% } %>
                    </div>
                    <p style="margin: 0 0 5px 0; font-weight: bold;">Name: <%= RA_FullName %>
                    </p>
                    <p style="margin: 0; font-weight: bold;">SIGNED AND DELIVERED<br>By the within named "Service
                        provider"</p>
                </td>
                <td class="signature-col">
                    <div class="signature-line">
                        <% if (typeof signature !=='undefined' && signature && signature.trim() !=='' ) { %>
                            <img src="<%= signature %>" alt="User Signature" class="signature-image" />
                            <% } else { %>
                                <p>______________________________</p>
                                <% } %>
                    </div>
                    <p style="margin: 0 0 5px 0; font-weight: bold;">Name: <%= UserName %>
                    </p>
                    <p style="margin: 0; font-weight: bold;">SIGNED AND DELIVERED<br>By the within named "User"</p>
                </td>
            </tr>
        </table>

        <!-- APPENDIX 1 -->
        <div class="appendix">
            <h2 style="font-size: 16pt; margin: 0 0 20px 0; text-align: center; font-weight: bold;">Appendix 1</h2>

            <h3 style="font-size: 12pt; margin: 20px 0 12px 0; font-weight: bold;">This Agreement shall be effective as
                of <%= EffectiveDate %> (the "Effective Date").</h3>
            <p style="margin: 0 0 25px 0; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;">Validity of the agreement: This agreement
                shall commence from <strong>
                    <%= StartDate %>
                </strong> and shall subsist till <strong>
                    <%= EndDate %>
                </strong>.</p>

            <h4 style="font-size: 11pt; margin: 20px 0 10px 0; font-weight: bold;">Fees:</h4>
            <p style="margin: 0 0 15px 0;">The User shall duly pay to Service Provider, the agreed fees for the services
                that Service Provider renders to the User and statutory charges, as applicable. Such fees and statutory
                charges shall be payable through the specified manner and modes communicated by InvestBay (including but
                not limited to payment gateways or processors like Cashfree, Razorpay etc.)</p>

            <h4 style="font-size: 11pt; margin: 20px 0 10px 0; font-weight: bold;">Arbitration:</h4>
            <p style="margin: 0 0 10px 0;">The Parties therefore agree that they will, at all times, act in good faith,
                and make all attempts to resolve all differences / disputes howsoever arising out of or in connection
                with this Agreement by discussion failing which, the Parties shall resolve the same through arbitration.
                SEBI's proposed grievance redressal will be followed. In case, it's outside the purview of regulator,
                then the arbitration shall in all disputes be conducted in accordance with the provisions of the
                Arbitration and Conciliation Act, 1996 and the amendments made from time to time. The place and seat of
                arbitration shall be <strong>
                    <%= jurisdiction_place %>
                </strong>. The language to be used in the arbitration proceedings shall be English.</p>

            <h4 style="font-size: 11pt; margin: 20px 0 10px 0; font-weight: bold;">Governing law and Jurisdiction:</h4>
            <p style="margin: 0 0 15px 0;">This Agreement shall be governed by and construed and enforced in accordance
                with the laws of India. The Parties agree to submit to the exclusive jurisdiction of the courts at
                <strong>
                    <%= jurisdiction_place %>
                </strong>.
            </p>

            <h4 style="font-size: 11pt; margin: 20px 0 10px 0; font-weight: bold;">Service Identification:</h4>
            <p style="margin: 0 0 15px 0;">The service identified as '<%= service_name %> as displayed on InvestBay.in'
                    (hereinafter referred to as 'the Service') is being purchased by the user (hereinafter referred to
                    as 'the User'). This agreement pertains specifically to the terms and conditions governing the
                    provision of '<%= service_name %> as displayed on InvestBay.in' by <%= RA_FullName %> (hereinafter
                            referred to as 'the Service provider'). This clause is to ensure clarity by explicitly
                            stating that the agreement applies to the service '<%= service_name %> as displayed on
                                InvestBay.in' among the various services offered by the Service provider, thereby
                                preventing any potential confusion.</p>

            <h4 style="font-size: 11pt; margin: 20px 0 10px 0; font-weight: bold;">Termination Process and Refund
                Timeline:</h4>
            <p style="margin: 0 0 10px 0;">Either Party may terminate this Agreement by providing a written notice of at
                least 7 (seven) calendar days via email. In the event of termination:</p>
            <ul style="margin: 0 0 15px 25px; padding-left: 20px;">
                <li>The User shall be eligible for a proportionate refund as per the refund clause.</li>
                <li>The Service Provider shall process any eligible refund within 15 business days from the date of
                    termination confirmation.</li>
                <li>Access to subscription services shall be revoked at the end of the notice period.</li>
            </ul>

            <h4 style="font-size: 11pt; margin: 20px 0 10px 0; font-weight: bold;">Subscription Description:</h4>
            <p style="margin: 0 0 10px 0;">The subscription taken by the User is governed by the descriptions and terms
                provided by the Relevant Authority (Service provider). These descriptions, which outline the specific
                services, limitations, and other relevant details associated with the subscription, are hereby
                incorporated into this agreement by reference. The detailed description provided by the Service provider
                is essential for understanding the scope and limitations of the subscription and the description is
                mentioned below. The Service Provider may update or revise the subscription description to reflect
                changes in scope, structure, or compliance requirements. In such cases, the User shall be notified by
                service provider via registered email. Continued use of services for more than 7 days post-notification
                shall be deemed as acceptance of the updated terms. If the User disagrees, they may opt to discontinue
                the service and seek a proportionate refund, as per the refund clause.</p>

            <h4 style="font-size: 11pt; margin: 25px 0 12px 0; font-weight: bold;">Declaration by Client/User</h4>
            <div style="padding: 15px; margin-bottom: 20px; border: 1px solid #000;">
                <p style="margin: 0 0 8px 0;">The User acknowledges that they have reviewed and understood these
                    description as provided by the Service provider at the time of subscription.</p>
                <p style="margin: 0 0 8px 0;">Any changes or updates to the subscription description by the Service
                    provider shall be communicated to the User and shall become part of this agreement.</p>
                <p style="margin: 0 0 8px 0; font-weight: bold;">"I / We have read and understood the terms and
                    conditions applicable to a research analyst as defined under regulation 2(1)(u) of the SEBI
                    (Research Analyst) Regulations, 2014, including the fee structure.</p>
                <p style="margin: 0 0 8px 0;">I/We are subscribing to the research services for our own benefits and
                    consumption, and any reliance placed on the research report provided by research analyst shall be as
                    per our own judgement and assessment of the conclusions contained in the research report.</p>
                <p style="margin: 0 0 8px 0;"><strong>I/We understand that –</strong></p>
                <ul style="margin: 0 0 8px 20px;">
                    <li>Any investment made based on the recommendations in the research report are subject to market
                        risk.</li>
                    <li>Recommendations in the research report do not provide any assurance of returns.</li>
                    <li>There is no recourse to claim any losses incurred on the investments made based on the
                        recommendations in the research report.</li>
                </ul>
            </div>

            <h4 style="font-size: 11pt; margin: 25px 0 12px 0; font-weight: bold;">Risk factors:</h4>
            <div style="padding: 15px; border: 1px solid #000;">
                <p style="margin: 0 0 8px 0;">Investments in Securities are subject to market risks and there is no
                    assurance or guarantee in case of investment based on our recommendations. Risk factor can be
                    affected as market risk, Market trading risk, lack of market liquidity, regulatory risk, asset Class
                    Risk, performance risk, credit risk, model risk or such as may be prescribe from time to time.</p>
                <p style="margin: 0 0 8px 0;">The research recommendations may be affected by changes in Government
                    policies, general levels of interest rates and risks associated with trading volumes, liquidity and
                    settlement systems in equity and debt markets.</p>
                <p style="margin: 0 0 8px 0;">The names of the research reports or products do not in any manner
                    indicate their prospects or returns.</p>
                <p style="margin: 0 0 8px 0;">Our past performance of research recommendation are not indicative of the
                    future performance or correctness.</p>
                <p style="margin: 0 0 8px 0;">Investments made by the Client based on the recommendations of the RA are
                    subject to risks arising from the investment objective, investment strategy and asset allocation.
                </p>
                <p style="margin: 0 0 8px 0;">The investments made by the Client based on the recommendations of RA may
                    be adversely affected by the performance of individual companies, changes in the market dynamics,
                    company specific and industry specific and macroeconomic and regulatory factors.</p>
                <p style="margin: 0 0 8px 0;">Recommendations in securities or Investments in niche sectors run the risk
                    of volatility, high valuation, obsolescence and low liquidity.</p>
                <p style="margin: 0;">Investments on our recommendations in derivatives, futures and options are
                    affected by risk different from those associated with stock and bonds. Such investments are highly
                    leveraged instruments and their use requires a high degree of skill, diligence and expertise. Small
                    price movements in the underlying security may have a large impact on the value of derivatives and
                    futures and options. Some of the risks relate to mis-pricing on the improper valuation of
                    derivatives and futures and options and the inability to correlate the positions with underlying
                    assets, rates and indices.</p>
            </div>

            <!-- SUBSCRIPTION DETAILS -->
            <div style="padding: 20px; margin: 25px 0; border: 1px solid #000;">
                <h4 style="margin: 0 0 12px 0; font-size: 11pt; font-weight: bold;">
                    <%= subscription_description %>
                </h4>
                <h5 style="margin: 0 0 12px 0; font-size: 10pt; font-weight: bold;">
                    <%= combination_details %>
                </h5>
                <p style="margin: 0; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt;">
                    <%= ask_mentor %>
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- FOOTER -->
        <div class="footer">
            <p style="margin: 0 0 8px 0;">investbay.in | SEBI Registered Research Analyst Services </p>
            <p style="margin: 0;">This is a legally binding document. Please review carefully before signing.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>

</html>